  ozelFonksiyon: 
  aciklama:
  - "Farkl\u0131 y\xF6nlerdeki telvelerin birle\u015Fti\u011Fi merkezi bir k\u0131s\u0131mda,
    da\u011F\u0131n\u0131k ebru desenleri g\xF6r\xFCyorum. \U0001F914Bu bir \"anlam
    aray\u0131\u015F\u0131na\" ve bir \"sorgulamaya\" i\u015Faret ediyor. San\u0131r\u0131m
    {{data, yasmax=24, k\u0131z arkada\u015F\u0131ndan | yasmin=24, sevgilin han\u0131mefendiden}}
    ayr\u0131lmadan \xF6nce, onun do\u011Fru ki\u015Fi oldu\u011Fu inanc\u0131n\u0131
    per\xE7inlemeye \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131rcas\u0131na, i\u015Faretler t\xFCretiyordun.
    \u015Eimdi de neden ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 sorgulamaya ve
    buna bir mana vermeye \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131yorsun. Anlam aray\u0131\u015F\u0131yla,
    ger\xE7ekli\u011Fini \u0131skal\u0131yorsun {{isim}}. Derin d\xFC\u015F\xFCnerek,
    odaklanman ve yapman gerekenleri ka\xE7\u0131r\u0131yorsun. \xD6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki
    g\xFCnlerde i\u015F sana d\xFC\u015Fecek. {{data, yasmax=24, Ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    k\u0131z arkada\u015F\u0131na | yasmin=24, Ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n han\u0131mefendiye}}
    yapaca\u011F\u0131n bir izah, durumu tersine \xE7evirebilir.\n\nFincan\u0131n\u0131n
    orta k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131nda bir de \"pusula\" var. \U0001F9ED \u0130li\u015Fkinde
    \xE7\u0131kan sorunlar\u0131n akl\u0131n\u0131 \xE7eldi\u011Fini ve \"do\u011Fru
    olan\" y\xF6n\xFCn\xFC \u015Fa\u015F\u0131rtt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCyorum.
    {{data, yasmax=24, Ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n k\u0131z arkada\u015F\u0131nla
    | yasmin=24, Ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n han\u0131mefendiyle}} ilgili olumlu
    olan baz\u0131 fikirlerin, olumsuza d\xF6nm\xFC\u015F ve \"onlu bir gelece\u011Fe\"
    olan inanc\u0131n\u0131 yitirmeye ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n {{isim}}. Bu
    konudaki de\u011Ferlendirmenin yanl\u0131\u015F oldu\u011Funu ve birbiriniz i\xE7in
    halen \xE7ok hay\u0131rl\u0131 g\xF6z\xFCkt\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFCz\xFC bilmeni isterim."
